# Delivered runtime products → the agent's scanned skill scope at install: the bundle's PAYLOAD skills, each a
# namespaced `<name>/SKILL.md` (doc 06/07). Empty by default — a fresh `bundle new` ships NO payload skill;
# add one on demand with `wpm bundle <id> skills add <name>`, which scaffolds the stub AND registers it in
# bundle.yml. This `.keep` just preserves the slot so the delivery surface is uniform with payload/files and
# payload/templates (a bundle that delivers no runtime skill simply leaves it empty).
